<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MoneyGram said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MoneyGram said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney started coverage of MoneyGram Payment Systems Inc with a buy rating, a source at Smith Barney said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- MoneyGram shares closed Monday at 12-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
